    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game is currently in a &quot;Closed Beta&quot; phase of development. Price Reductions and Content Releases will happen periodically. Please join now if you wish help shape the future of the game. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you want a fully finished product - stay away (for now)!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Endgame-first ARPG. Infinite progression. No story\u2014just the grind.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your limits in The Eternal Hunt, an action RPG built for those who crave deep character progression, powerful loot, and an ever-evolving endgame. Skip the filler\u2014dive straight into the hunt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE GRIND</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Combat &amp; Customization:</strong> Choose your class, forge your build, and wield devastating abilities. Every decision matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Progression:</strong> Face <strong>Khazul\u2019s Maze</strong>, <strong>Boss Encounters, Time Fragments</strong>, <strong>Anomalies</strong>, and <strong>The Execution Grounds</strong>, each offering <strong>scaling difficulty </strong>and<strong> leaderboards! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Hand-Holding:</strong> No story campaign, no scripted moments\u2014just <strong>pure ARPG gameplay</strong> focused on loot and power growth.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOT WITHOUT LIMITS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary Items &amp; Crafting:</strong> Find, forge, and reroll your way to the perfect build with <strong>Vorrak\u2019s Forge</strong> and powerful <strong>Currencies</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Item Types:</strong> Equip <strong>Symbols</strong> that grant passive buffs <strong>while stored in your inventory</strong>, forcing tactical trade-offs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timewarped Affixes:</strong> Exclusive to <strong>Anomalies</strong>, these modifiers <strong>push affix values beyond normal limits</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auction House:</strong> Trade your hard-earned wares with other players in exchange for Diamonds! (resets upon Season and exclusive Hardcore/Softcore houses).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605340/extras/0f58cf72734df102cc4142361fd3d1db.avif?t=1752603583\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTER DEVELOPMENT &amp; BUILDCRAFT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Unique Passive Trees\u00a0</strong>\u2192 Put points into multiple thematic passive trees that offer stat boosts and Unique Keystones to choose from!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Sub Class specific (e.g. Pyromancer) and Class specific (e.g. Mage) Skills in the Codex.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further customise your chosen Skills by acquiring Vials that allow you to put points into their individual Skill Trees and unlock potent skill boosts and play-style defining Keystones!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605340/extras/28cee7f94d814d858e14c1226d6cb094.avif?t=1752603583\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605340/extras/c0865aee9d76682679cbf61196b33a35.avif?t=1752603583\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605340/extras/17a4b334b5d9ab326cb79ece459411dc.avif?t=1752603583\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Gems &amp; Support Gems</strong> \u2192 Further <strong>customize your playstyle</strong> by slotting gems into your <strong>Relic and Charm</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Gems</strong> \u2192 Grant access to <strong>globally useful Active Skills</strong>, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auras</strong> (e.g., increased damage, resistances).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banners</strong> (temporary power boosts).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement Skills</strong> (dash, teleport, etc.).</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support Gems</strong> \u2192 Provide <strong>passive stat boosts</strong> that are always active, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>% Increased Fire Damage</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+ Levels to Active Skills</strong></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Skill Gems</strong> drop <strong>exclusively from Khazul</strong>, making endgame challenges a key part of unlocking the most powerful abilities.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDGAME CONTENT THAT NEVER STOPS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Khazul\u2019s Maze:</strong> A <strong>procedural, multi-floor dungeon</strong> with increasing difficulty and <strong>endless cycles</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605340/extras/ec85f3db7018b51e6290ccc2d6cb65ab.poster.avif?t=1752603583\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605340/extras/ec85f3db7018b51e6290ccc2d6cb65ab.webm?t=1752603583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605340/extras/ec85f3db7018b51e6290ccc2d6cb65ab.mp4?t=1752603583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Execution Grounds:</strong> <strong>Time-based survival trials</strong> that test your speed and efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounters:</strong> Face off in a 1v1 battle to the death with the biggest and toughest bosses around!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Fragments:</strong> <strong>Customizable maps\u00a0</strong>where you control the risk and rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605340/extras/eb4744d307596c04d4e142b21f93568d.poster.avif?t=1752603583\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605340/extras/eb4744d307596c04d4e142b21f93568d.webm?t=1752603583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605340/extras/eb4744d307596c04d4e142b21f93568d.mp4?t=1752603583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalies:</strong> <strong>Level 100+ rifts</strong> with extreme modifiers, <strong>multiple boss encounters</strong>, and the best loot in the game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER &amp; COMPETITION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op (not currently enabled):</strong> Take on the hunt <strong>alone or with friends</strong> in drop-in multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Hub:</strong> Trade, showcase your build, and queue up with players in the <strong>dedicated server lobby</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Seasons:</strong> Compete in <strong>high-score leaderboards</strong> for Khazul\u2019s Maze and Execution Grounds, <strong>with seasonal resets and exclusive rewards</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS &amp; COMMUNITY FEEDBACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re launching in <strong>Early Access</strong> to fine-tune balance, add new content, and integrate community feedback. Expect <strong>frequent updates, new gear, fresh challenges, and evolving endgame mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO STORY. JUST THE GRIND.</strong> Are you ready for The Eternal Hunt?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcac Join the Community:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Wishlist Now</strong> \ud83d\udd39 <strong>Join Discord</strong> \ud83d\udd39 <strong>Join X</strong>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Follow for Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605340/extras/342fe7b0104f3a613151f00b13808f8a.avif?t=1752603583\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This game is designed for players who love deep buildcraft, endless progression, and tough endgame challenges. If you seek a narrative-driven ARPG, this may not be for you.</i></p>",
